      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Four Bedroom Homes\r\n\r\nThe four-bedroom homes at Mercer's Court offer exceptional space, comfort and flexibility for modern family living. Extending from 146 sq.m (1,571 sq.ft.), these generously proportioned homes have been thoughtfully designed to provide a perfect balance of stylish open-plan living and private family spaces.\r\n\r\nLight-filled interiors and carefully considered layouts create homes that are both elegant and practical, with spacious living and dining areas, contemporary kitchens and well-appointed bedrooms designed to accommodate the changing needs of family life. Every detail has been considered to deliver a home of lasting quality, combining high-specification finishes with excellent energy efficiency for comfortable, sustainable living.\r\n\r\nSet within an exclusive development of just 11 homes, the four-bedroom residences at Mercer's Court offer a rare opportunity to enjoy a spacious new home in the heart of Rathcoole Village. With an excellent range of schools, shops, cafés and recreational amenities all within walking distance, together with superb access to the N7, M50 and Dublin City Centre, Mercer's Court is ideally positioned for families seeking a connected village lifestyle without compromising on space or convenience.\r\n\r\nFor further information please call Savills New Homes on (01) 618 1300 or register interest on www.mercerscourt.ie"
      },
